From: allolive <160342668+allolive@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 13 Sep 2026 11:00:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] VideoDatabase: read the artwork of a list in one query

Add GetArtForItems, which fetches the art of many media ids in a single
query, and use it from VideoThumbLoader in batches of 500 so filling a list
costs one round trip per batch instead of one per item.

Signed-off-by: allolive <160342668+allolive@users.noreply.github.com>

--- a/xbmc/video/VideoDatabase.cpp
+++ b/xbmc/video/VideoDatabase.cpp
@@ -74,6 +74,7 @@
 #include <memory>
 #include <ranges>
 #include <set>
